---
title: GHOST — error recovery
---
%% Intended design; not runtime evidence
flowchart TD
  Error["Detected error"] --> Classify{"Boundary?"}
  Classify -->|Tracker| GhostCancel["Cancel Ghost and invalidate epoch"]
  GhostCancel --> Off["Close camera and show unavailable"]
  Off --> Retry{"Explicit retry?"}
  Retry -->|Yes| Restart["Bounded child restart"]
  Retry -->|No| Keyboard["Continue shortcut mode"]
  Classify -->|UIA| Kill["Expire capability and terminate stalled worker"]
  Kill --> Uncertain["Report timeout or uncertain outcome"]
  Uncertain --> NoRetry["Never retry action automatically"]
  Classify -->|Storage| Preserve["Preserve committed generation and valid assets"]
  Preserve --> ReadOnly["Retry or recovery read-only view"]
  Classify -->|Overlay| Hide["Hide unsafe overlay"]
  Hide --> Shell["Normal settings and diagnostics"]
  Classify -->|Capture| Dispose["Dispose volatile frame; show retry or cancel"]
  Restart --> Valid{"Ready and validated?"}
  Valid -->|Yes| Disarmed["Resume disarmed"]
  Valid -->|No| Keyboard
